# scenes/default.scene
#
# The built-in default scene, expressed in the data-driven scene format
# (see docs/scene_format.md). This file is the canonical source for the
# default scene: it is byte-for-byte the text embedded in the binary via
# src/default_scene_text.h, and its body is exactly what `--write-scene`
# emits for the built-in description.
#
# Rendering this file is byte-identical to the embedded default parsed from
# src/default_scene_text.h (verified at 1920x1080/16 spp, 1280x720/16 spp
# and 320x180/4 spp, depth 6, seed 1337).

